{
  "rule": "crates/canvas-proto/src/pattern.rs fit_kind: the same LED count and arrangement is exact; a light of one LED is one_led; the same arrangement is stretched; anything else is other_shape. The order matters: a light of one LED is one_led even when its arrangement differs, and a pattern built on one LED of another arrangement is other_shape.",
